Notes: The broadcast navigation file is read only to START the satellites' orbits; the stations
  start on a plane and GM 25 % low, and fog checks that restarts from other starts land on the same
  solution (restarts in the output). raw/ is the same set of files as data/gps/raw: fog fetch
  sat-doppler links to it when it is there, else downloads. The target is slow (about half an hour
  on four cores): fog build all skips it, make ci-full runs it.

Written by `fog build explain` from data/sat/dataset.json and data/sat/inputs.lock: edit those, not this file.
